## 36. Matrix Display ✅

Displays matrices/tensors.

---

## 37. Complex Plane Viewer ❌ (needs complex math)

Complex number visualization.

---

## 38. Vector Field Display ❌ (needs OpenGL)

Arrow-based flow visualization.

---

## 39. Equation Renderer ❌ (needs LaTeX)

Displays mathematical formulas.

Example:

genui{"math_block_widget_always_prefetch_v2":{"content":"f(x)=ax^2+bx+c"}}

---

## 40. Function Graph ❌ (needs plotting library)

Plots equations/functions directly.

Example:

genui{"math_block_widget_always_prefetch_v2":{"content":"y=\sin(x)"}}

---

